st14-galaxy-planet-earth = Earth
st14-galaxy-planet-earth-desc = Capital of the Federation. Fleets leave from here and heroes come back here.
st14-galaxy-planet-mars = Mars
st14-galaxy-planet-mars-desc = Shipyards and mobile infantry boot camps.
st14-galaxy-planet-pluto = Pluto
st14-galaxy-planet-pluto-desc = Ice outpost at the edge of the Sol system, a deep watch station.
st14-galaxy-planet-sirius = Sirius Prime
st14-galaxy-planet-sirius-desc = Farm world that feeds half the fleet.
st14-galaxy-planet-tau-ceti = Tau Ceti IV
st14-galaxy-planet-tau-ceti-desc = Cold colony with a long range relay.
st14-galaxy-planet-sanctuary = Sanctuary
st14-galaxy-planet-sanctuary-desc = Resort world and hospital base of the fleet.
st14-galaxy-planet-hesperus = Hesperus
st14-galaxy-planet-hesperus-desc = Border fortress. The bugs have already tested its walls.
st14-galaxy-planet-zegema = Zegema Beach
st14-galaxy-planet-zegema-desc = Coastal colony. The bugs have landed here twice.
st14-galaxy-planet-hydra = Hydra IV
st14-galaxy-planet-hydra-desc = Swamp world where the front moves every week.
st14-galaxy-planet-ghutana = Ghutana
st14-galaxy-planet-ghutana-desc = Dusty plains and mines. The garrison holds on with the last of its strength.
st14-galaxy-planet-tango-urilla = Tango Urilla
st14-galaxy-planet-tango-urilla-desc = Jungle and fog. Recon cannot see past a hundred metres.
st14-galaxy-planet-rigel = Rigel IV
st14-galaxy-planet-rigel-desc = Scorched world taken by the bugs. A stop on the way to Klendathu.
st14-galaxy-planet-varuna = Varuna
st14-galaxy-planet-varuna-desc = Ocean planet where the fleet holds a foothold on an archipelago.
st14-galaxy-planet-antares = Chimera
st14-galaxy-planet-antares-desc = Red deserts by Antares, a whole regiment went missing here.
st14-galaxy-planet-gehenna = Gehenna
st14-galaxy-planet-gehenna-desc = Volcanic hell covered with hives. A landing is suicide.
st14-galaxy-planet-klendathu = Klendathu
st14-galaxy-planet-klendathu-desc = Home world of the arachnids. The planet is split into sectors, and each one is fought over.
st14-galaxy-planet-quarantine = Obren
st14-galaxy-planet-quarantine-desc = Dead world in the quarantine zone. The bug asteroids come from here.
st14-galaxy-planet-planet-p = Planet P
st14-galaxy-planet-planet-p-desc = Ice planet where a brain bug was seen. The data is classified.
